  "description": "A RELATIONSHIP YOU CAN TRUST. The Ultra combines sporty mountain bike DNA with impressive versatility, making it the ideal companion for riders who don't want to choose between everyday practicality and adventure. Its modern aluminium frame blends low weight with outstanding durability, delivering a precise and confidence-inspiring ride. The ba lanced geometry, featuring a longer reach and a slacker head angle, provides excellent stability and control on descents without sacrificing agility. Technical highlights such as the Boost rear end with thru-axles and the triple-butted aluminium frame have been purpose-built for modern drivetrain systems, offering an ideal balance of efficiency, stiffness, durability, and low weight. Thanks to integrated mounting points for fenders, a rear rack, and a kickstand, the ULTRA adapts effortlessly to a wide range of riding scenarios – from a sporty trail bike to a reliable everyday companion.",
